{"seq":4,"slug":"anchors-and-boundaries","title":"锚点与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/regex-fundamentals/anchors-and-boundaries","wordCount":927,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"锚点与边界\">锚点与边界</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>锚点（Anchor）与边界（Boundary）是一类<strong>零宽断言</strong>：它们不匹配具体字符，而是匹配字符之间的<strong>位置</strong>，因此不消耗输入、也不出现在匹配结果中。<code>^</code> <code>$</code> 定位行/串的首尾，<code>\\b</code> <code>\\B</code> 定位单词边界，其行为受多行标志 <code>m</code> 控制。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>行锚点：<code>^</code> 匹配行首、<code>$</code> 匹配行尾，默认作用于整个字符串，<code>m</code> 标志使其作用于每一行。</li>\n<li>单词边界 <code>\\b</code> 匹配 <code>\\w</code> 与 <code>\\W</code> 之间的位置，<code>\\B</code> 是其取反（两个同类字符之间）。</li>\n<li>输入验证必须双锚定 <code>^...$</code>，确保匹配整个字符串而非其中的子串。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"零宽断言的概念\">零宽断言的概念</h2><p>锚点（Anchor）和边界（Boundary）是一类特殊的正则元素：它们不匹配具体字符，而是匹配字符之间的<strong>位置</strong>。因此也被称为零宽断言（Zero-width Assertion）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const startsWith = /^Hello/;&#10;startsWith.test(&#39;Hello World&#39;);&#10;startsWith.test(&#39;Say Hello&#39;);&#10;&#10;const endsWith = /World$/;&#10;endsWith.test(&#39;Hello World&#39;);&#10;endsWith.test(&#39;World Cup&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> startsWith</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">Hello</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">startsWith.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Hello World'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">startsWith.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Say Hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> endsWith</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">World</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">endsWith.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Hello World'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">endsWith.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'World Cup'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>锚点</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>匹配位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>^</code></td>\n<td>字符串/行的开头</td>\n<td>第一个字符之前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>$</code></td>\n<td>字符串/行的结尾</td>\n<td>最后一个字符之后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>\\b</code></td>\n<td>单词边界</td>\n<td>单词字符与非单词字符之间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>\\B</code></td>\n<td>非单词边界</td>\n<td>两个同类字符之间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>\\A</code></td>\n<td>字符串绝对开头</td>\n<td>仅字符串起始位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>\\Z</code></td>\n<td>字符串绝对结尾</td>\n<td>仅字符串结束位置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;字符串: Hello World&quot;&#10;        POS0[&quot;^&quot;] --- H[&quot;H&quot;] --- E[&quot;e&quot;] --- L1[&quot;l&quot;] --- L2[&quot;l&quot;] --- O[&quot;o&quot;]&#10;        O --- SP[&quot;\\\\b &quot;] --- W[&quot;W&quot;] --- O2[&quot;o&quot;] --- R[&quot;r&quot;] --- L3[&quot;l&quot;] --- D[&quot;d&quot;] --- POS1[&quot;$&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"字符串: Hello World\"\n        POS0[\"^\"] --- H[\"H\"] --- E[\"e\"] --- L1[\"l\"] --- L2[\"l\"] --- O[\"o\"]\n        O --- SP[\"\\\\b \"] --- W[\"W\"] --- O2[\"o\"] --- R[\"r\"] --- L3[\"l\"] --- D[\"d\"] --- POS1[\"$\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"行首与行尾锚点\">行首与行尾锚点</h2><p><code>^</code> 和 <code>$</code> 的行为取决于是否启用了多行模式（<code>m</code> 标志）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const text = &#39;line1\\nline2\\nline3&#39;;&#10;&#10;text.match(/^\\w+/);&#10;text.match(/^\\w+/gm);&#10;&#10;text.match(/\\w+$/);&#10;text.match(/\\w+$/gm);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'line1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">line2</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">line3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">text.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">text.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">gm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">text.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">text.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">gm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th><code>^</code> 匹配位置</th>\n<th><code>$</code> 匹配位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>默认</td>\n<td>字符串开头</td>\n<td>字符串结尾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多行 <code>m</code></td>\n<td>每行开头</td>\n<td>每行结尾</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;默认模式&quot;&#10;        S1[&quot;^line1\\\\nline2\\\\nline3$&quot;]&#10;        S1 --&gt; R1[&quot;^ 匹配字符串起始&quot;]&#10;        S1 --&gt; R2[&quot;$ 匹配字符串结束&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;多行模式 /m&quot;&#10;        S2[&quot;^line1$\\\\n^line2$\\\\n^line3$&quot;]&#10;        S2 --&gt; R3[&quot;^ 匹配每行起始&quot;]&#10;        S2 --&gt; R4[&quot;$ 匹配每行结束&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"默认模式\"\n        S1[\"^line1\\\\nline2\\\\nline3$\"]\n        S1 --&gt; R1[\"^ 匹配字符串起始\"]\n        S1 --&gt; R2[\"$ 匹配字符串结束\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"多行模式 /m\"\n        S2[\"^line1$\\\\n^line2$\\\\n^line3$\"]\n        S2 --&gt; R3[\"^ 匹配每行起始\"]\n        S2 --&gt; R4[\"$ 匹配每行结束\"]\n    end</pre><p>常见的行锚点使用模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const emptyLine = /^$/m;&#10;const commentLine = /^\\s*\\/\\//m;&#10;const indentedLine = /^[ \\t]+\\S/m;&#10;&#10;const multiline = `&#10;function hello() {&#10;  return &#39;world&#39;;&#10;}&#10;`;&#10;multiline.match(/^\\s*return.*;$/m);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> emptyLine</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> commentLine</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/\\/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> indentedLine</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[ \\t]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\S</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> multiline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">function hello() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  return 'world';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">multiline.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><strong>提示：</strong> 在验证用户输入时，始终同时使用 <code>^</code> 和 <code>$</code> 锚定整个字符串。例如 <code>/^\\d{6}$/</code> 确保输入恰好是 6 位数字，而 <code>/\\d{6}/</code> 只要求字符串中包含连续 6 位数字。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"单词边界\">单词边界</h2><p><code>\\b</code> 匹配单词字符（<code>\\w</code>）与非单词字符（<code>\\W</code>）之间的位置，或字符串的开头/结尾与单词字符之间的位置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const wholeWord = /\\bcat\\b/;&#10;wholeWord.test(&#39;cat&#39;);&#10;wholeWord.test(&#39;category&#39;);&#10;wholeWord.test(&#39;concatenate&#39;);&#10;&#10;const text = &#39;cat catalog catfish scattered&#39;;&#10;text.match(/\\bcat\\b/g);&#10;text.match(/\\bcat/g);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> wholeWord</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\\b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\\b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">wholeWord.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cat'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">wholeWord.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=